# Trivy ignore file — passed to every image scan via --ignorefile.
#
# Intentionally empty. pip's own vendored packages (msgpack, setuptools,
# urllib3, ...) are no longer allowlisted here one CVE at a time: the scans pass
# --skip-files '**/site-packages/pip/_vendor/bom.cdx.json' instead. That file is
# pip's CycloneDX SBOM of what it vendors, which Trivy 0.55 reports as installed
# packages; pip never runs in the image. Switched 2026-10-31.
#
# Add an entry only for a finding that genuinely does not apply here, with the
# reason and a re-review date beside it.
